Aaron Carter's twin sister Angel is  paying tribute to her brother after his  tragic death in an Instagram post Angel  shared a heartfelt message writing quote  to my twin I loved you beyond measure  you will be missed dearly my funny sweet  Aaron I have so many memories of you and  I and I promise to cherish them I know  you're at peace now I will carry you  with me until the day I die and get to  see you again  [Music]  I love making music it's definitely my  happy place Aaron who shot to fame with  his music career in the late 90s was  found dead on Saturday at his home in  California just outside of Los Angeles  with Aaron's manager Taylor helgeson  confirming his death to ET following the  news Aaron was 34 an official cause of  death has not yet been revealed  the last few years haven't been easy for  Aaron and his family what I need is  people to  understand that I'm human and I make  mistakes just like every other human in  this world after going public about his  issues with mental health in 2019 Angel  and their older brother Nick filed a  restraining order against Aaron leading  to a rift between the siblings Aaron  loves his family very much and that's  where his heart is at and that's where  he's coming from he's coming from Love  and he's just wanting to see it return  despite their many highs and lows Nick  too shared a tribute for his baby  brother the 42 year old Backstreet Boys  singer wrote in part quote my heart is  broken even though my brother and I have  had a complicated relationship my love  for him has never ever faded sometimes  we want to blame someone or something  for a loss but the truth is that  addiction and mental illness is the real  villain here I will miss my brother more  than anyone will ever know I love you  chis now you can finally have the piece  you can never find here on Earth he says  if you're ever in trouble just call me  and I'll tell you and I'll guide you  through and talk to you about it and you  know because he's been through all that  kind of stuff amid his trained  relationship with his older brother Nick  he shared this touching message while  sitting down with E.T in 2017. if Nick  is watching this right now what would  you want to say to Nick he could just  look in that camera right there what  would you say I will always love you and  and I will always have forgiveness in my  heart for you  [Music]  foreign
 

